# PornBlocker - Full Protection

A self-control tool with 5 layers of blocking, a watchdog repair system, and a date lock.

---

## What It Blocks

| Layer | Method | Details |
|---|---|---|
| **Porn sites** | hosts file | 60+ domains → `0.0.0.0` |
| **NSFW subreddits** | hosts file | old.reddit.com + 20 NSFW subreddit paths |
| **Keywords** | Windows Registry | 30+ keywords → Parental Controls filter |
| **Apps** | Process killer | Kills blocked .exe files every 30 sec |
| **DoH bypasses** | Registry + hosts | Disables DNS-over-HTTPS in Chrome/Edge/Firefox/Brave; blocks DoH provider domains |
| **Safe Search** | Registry policy | Forces Google Safe Search + YouTube Restricted Mode |

---

## Files

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `blocker_service.py` | Core Windows service — hosts, registry, process killer |
| `watchdog.py` | Repair script — restores deleted files, restarts stopped service |
| `install.py` | Installs everything — **run this first** |
| `uninstall.py` | Removes everything — only works after unlock date |

