## Notes

- Reddit itself is **not** fully blocked — only `old.reddit.com` and NSFW subreddit paths.
  Full Reddit blocking would break legitimate use.
- Some apps in `BLOCKED_PROCESSES` (VLC, MPC-HC) are commented with warnings —
  remove them from the list in `blocker_service.py` if you use them legitimately.
- DoH blocking via registry requires the browser to be restarted to take effect.
